{% block brandDescription %}
      <p class="brand-description">The Gibson Guitar Corporation (now known as Gibson Brands, Inc.) is an iconic American manufacturer of musical instruments, best known for its influential electric and acoustic guitars like the Les Paul model. Founded in 1894 and headquartered in Nashville, Tennessee, the company has a long history of craftsmanship and musical innovation.<br><a href="#" class="decoder-howto-link" data-modal-target="howto-gibson">(How to decode a Gibson serial #)</a></p>
